            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "maxItems": 2,
        "description": "Seconds from the template start when each element appears, in order: card, click. card = when it appears; click = the moment the button is pressed (e.g. on \"subscribe\"). Compute as (spoken word time − beat start time) from WhisperX."
